what's going on guys as you can probably  tell by the thumbnail and the title of  this video  today we're going to be examining the  hypothetical child of azuka midoriya and  ochako uraraka i actually made this  character up for a totally different  idea i'm working on  about who could be the 10th user of one  for all but as i began to flesh her  quirk out in my head  i realized she was probably worthy of  having her own quick video  this is the first time i've done a  totally original character before  so make sure you smash that like button  if this is something you would like to  see more of  also a quick update i now have new  emotes on the youtube channel  which can be used in the comments of my  videos whether you're on mobile or  desktop  my favorite one is probably the deku  crying one or the one of me reading  manga  but yeah you can get access to these by  just hitting the join button on my  channel  and becoming a member you'll be  supporting me personally if you do  and once more people join then i can  start adding new emojis  almost immediately okay so i decided to  call this character nori uraraka which  is a bit of a tongue twister to say out  loud  and the sensible reason she didn't take  madoria's last name was  for safety reasons and i'll elaborate on  that more in the next video about this  the name nori is a respectful reference  to all might whose real name was  toshinoriyagi  i personally do not see any future in  which deku has children  and doesn't name at least one of them  after all might in some way  it just has to happen anyway she is  technically the oldest child of deku's  family  as she was born 15 minutes before her  twin brother  due to the power of one for all being  public knowledge in the future  nori had a very protective and private  upbringing with her existence as the  daughter of the number one hero  being mostly unknown in the future the  threat of the quirk singularity is very  real  and quirks are becoming more and more  uncontrollable despite that  the luxury of proper quirk training is  still only given to those who want to be  heroes  after nori had a serious accident  involving her power  deku decided that she had to go to ua in  order to get the correct training  and avoid being a danger to society just  before we get into her quirk  i should mention that she carries around  this hyper density seal  as a support item and we've previously  seen these used by sir naitai in the  past  but we'll get into how nori uses this  once we explain her ability  her quirk is called gravity shift and it  has clear elements of her mother's zero  gravity power  and her grandmother's telekinetic  ability to begin  nori can use telekinesis to attract  people or objects towards her  with varying degrees of speed small  objects like a spoon  could be drawn towards her in seconds  whereas heavy objects like people or  cars  would be attracted in a much more slow  and controlled manner  depending on the weight her maximum  limit is 4 tons  and if she was to pull anything heavier  than that then you guessed it  the telekinetic pull works over a very  long range as long as she can see  something  she can pull it towards her but the  downside is that you know like i said  she has to see it first she couldn't  pull something on the other side of a  concrete wall because she can't see  through it  whereas she could pull something through  a window as long as that object or  person  remains visible to her the other  drawback is that her telekinesis can be  stopped completely  if she takes enough damage this is  similar to how seji's quirk operates  in that his victims can't escape until  he takes one too many hits  moving on once something is within  touching distance  then the pads on nori's fingers come  into play which is when she can activate  her true powers  after making contact with any of her  fingertips she can manipulate the  intensity of gravity  on a particular thing purely as an  example if she was to touch enosa with  one of her fingers  she could decide to multiply the  gravitational pull on his head  to a higher intensity than usual in this  example let's say she multiplies the  effect of gravity  by a hundred times this would result in  his head violently slamming into the  ground  and you know possibly killing him she  wouldn't go this far but it just shows  you how scary the power could be  another application might be multiplying  the gravitational pull  on someone's feet until they have no  choice but to start moving around like  this  or you could use it on a vehicle to stop  someone from escaping she could easily  restrain a person for 20 minutes with no  problem  whereas if she was to restrain a you  know a vehicle like i said  that would take a lot more effort and  she would start to feel sick a lot  quicker  similar to ochako nori could dial back  the effects of her quirk  and decide to nullify gravity instead  which causes weightlessness and allows  things to float  the effect only wears off if she decides  to press her fingertips together  and her current weight limit when doing  this is 4 tons  talking about support items now nori  carries this high density seal  which weighs 5 kilograms in total by  throwing this item at the correct angle  she can activate gravity shift just as  it leaves her fingertips  which will cause the seal to hit someone  with increased momentum  and because of the effect of gravity the  weight begins to increase until it can  floor someone completely  as a result when you take everything  into account she does have a lot of  options  she can pull people towards her from a  distance and then when she touches that  person  she can make them float or she can  restrain them with intense gravity  she can also turn her support item from  a small weight  into a killing machine and she can use  her telekinesis  to call it back like thor's hammer one  thing i forgot to mention was that she  can use the floating ability on herself  so if she touches her own body then she  can float just like ochako does  um i think that she can float easier  without throwing up straight away  but eventually you know if she does it  for long enough she will throw up  hopefully this video was a good  introduction to this character  and make sure to subscribe and turn on  notifications so you don't miss my  upcoming video  and it will be in a similar style to my  previous next generation videos  remember you can become a member and  support the channel just by going on  your laptop or  computer and then clicking the join  button by doing this you are not only  supporting me  but you get access to exclusive posts  for members only in the community tab  and obviously the emojis which you can  use in the comments of any one of my  videos  be sure to check it out and until the  next one peace out
 

